cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OnSIR, please cite the ontology and the accompanying paper."
title: "OnSIR: Ontology for Seed Irradiation and Plant Radiobiology"
abstract: >-
  A FAIR OWL 2 DL ontology of seed-irradiation treatments and their dose-dependent
  biological effects (hormetic, mutagenic, sterilizing), aligned to BFO, PO, NCBITaxon,
  ChEBI, PATO and ENVO, units in QUDT, with dose-to-effect axioms supporting description-logic reasoning.
type: dataset
version: "1.3.0"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/lfmalves/OnSIR"  # w3id redirect not yet registered
repository-code: "https://github.com/lfmalves/OnSIR"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - seed irradiation
  - plant radiobiology
  - radiohormesis
  - mutation breeding
  - OWL
  - description logic
